    "summary": "The bolt pistol has Ballistic Skill 3+. On arrival by Deep Strike, Servo-sentry lets the Aquilons fire its sentry weapon, whether that is the hot-shot volley gun or the flamer. In your Movement phase, Precision Drop lets them arrive more than 6″ away from every enemy unit, measured horizontally. Taking that closer placement makes them ineligible to charge through the end of that turn.",
